Buyer deposit handling (RE-DEP-03)

Issuer: Dunaj Reality s. r. o. · IČO 46 891 203 · Štúrova 8, 811 02 Bratislava  

Effective: 15 January 2026 · Owner: Conveyancing desk

A buyer's reservation deposit (rezervačná záloha) is placed in a notarial escrow account or an advocate's client account, never in the agency's operating account. Funds are deposited by the deadline in the reservation agreement, typically 3 business days.

Release follows the contract: to the seller at registration of title at the district land registry, back to the buyer on mutual cancellation, or into a dispute procedure.

Never co-mingle a deposit with agency funds; the agency is not licensed to hold client money.

Cash deposits are capped at EUR 5,000 by zákon č. 394/2012 Z. z., so a deposit above that limit arrives only by bank transfer.

Confirm receipt and every disbursement to both parties in writing on the same day.

